    "body": "(not directly related to JS API) Reading http://caniuse.com/#feat=fullscreen\nI see that the `:fullscreen` seems to not be supported by all. WebKit world seems to support `:full-screen`, I haven't tested yet, and I do not remember any compat issues about it, but I might not have been careful about it.\n",
