    "updated_at": "2022-07-20T12:23:08Z",
    "body": "A complication for aliasing is that the prefixed APIs fire prefixed event. To make them true aliases would probably require adding these events to the table in https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener-invoke, and accepting that it's possible for `element.requestFullscreen()` to end up firing the \"webkitfullscreenchange\" event.",
