    "body": "> See https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=242930\r\n\r\nok this was moved to [Implement the new fullscreen API](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=229333)\r\n\r\n> - Use the top layer instead of clobbering styles\r\n> - Update UA styles\r\n> - Unprefix\r\n> - Use Promise-based APIs\r\n> - Fix minor spec divergences\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
