    "updated_at": "2026-08-12T03:13:18Z",
    "body": "One example in favor of this being specced is that Plex checks for `requestFullScreen`, `webkitRequestFullScreen`, `mozRequestFullScreen`, and `msRequestFullscreen`, but not the standardized `requestFullscreen`. It also checks for the equivalent pre-spec prefixed `cancelFullScreen` names.",
